# The api image builds from the repo root (it needs web/messages and
# web/src/i18n/locales.json, the shared i18n bundle of docs/architecture.md §8),
# so everything the image does not need is excluded here to keep the context small
# and to guarantee a local .env can never be baked into a layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.gitignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
.venv
docs/
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/out
